{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25939","headline":"寄福州从事殷尧藩 · 鲍溶","name":"寄福州从事殷尧藩","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"越岭寒轻物象殊，海城台阁似蓬壶。\n几回入市鲛绡女，终岁啼花山鹧鸪。\n雷令劒龙知去未，虎夷云鹤亦来无。\n就中静事冥宵话，何惜双轮访病夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}